From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Roman Leventov <leventov.ru@gmail.com>
Date: Sun, 8 Nov 2026 16:04:04 +0800
Subject: [PATCH 17/18] browser: trace mutation socket decoding and response
 handling

Include the sync-protocol session ID in enqueue observations so callers can correlate payload-free mutation traces with backend request IDs. Keep this identifier distinct from authentication state and preserve it across reconnects.

Record socket callback entry, decoded mutation response, and completed response handling on the guarded monotonic clock. Preserve listener exceptions and mutation settlement if optional tracing fails. Cover the timing boundaries, reconnect identity, and failed-clock handling in mutation tracing tests.
